cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it."
title: "nanoGPT-Seis-Posttrain: SFT and verifier RL on a 113M seismology model"
abstract: >-
  Phase II (supervised fine-tuning) and Phase III (reinforcement learning from
  programmatic verifiers) on top of a 113M from-scratch seismology model, built
  to make post-training legible — and to measure honestly what each phase does
  and does not change. Includes the measurement scaffolding the results depend
  on: split contracts, metric floors and ceilings, a pinned decoding contract,
  adversarial reward probes, and a documented atlas of the evaluation failures
  encountered along the way.
